  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Among the following compounds <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which one forms a yellow precipitate on reacting sequentially with (i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> (ii) dil. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> (iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>?</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/995f73c6-b3ee-4e4c-83f7-1178f02a55b4-image.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
